  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 400°F (200°C).",
    "Season the trout fillets with salt and black pepper.",
    "Heat olive oil in a skillet over medium-high heat. Sear the trout fillets for 2-3 minutes per side, or until cooked through.",
    "Transfer the trout to a baking sheet and bake in the oven for an additional 5-7 minutes, or until cooked to your liking.",
    "While the trout is cooking, mix together fish sauce, lemon juice, chopped parsley, and chopped chives in a small bowl.",
    "Once the trout is done, top each fillet with the fish sauce mixture and serve in a lacquerware bowl with toasted bread on the side.",
    "Garnish with additional parsley and chives, if desired.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy!"
